  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Feasibility Study - FLOOD FORECASTING AND EARLY WARNING SYSTEM, through Government of Turkey</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This $507,420 funds a Flood Forecasting and Early Warning System Feasibliity Study (FS) for the Turkish State Meteorological Service (TSMS). The FS develops an implementation plan to assist TSMS in determining its national-level Flood Forecasting and Early Warning System needs, including hardware, software, Geographic Information Systems (GISs), Relational Database Management Systems (RDMSs), sensors, weather and water monitoring equipment, communications equipment, and modeling systems. The FS will reduce economic losses, and risks to life, health, and safety, due to flooding in Turkey.</narrative>
  </description>
